WHAT YOU WILL LEARN IN THIS VIDEO
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* What the Document Object Model (DOM) is and how browsers create it
* How to use getElementById, getElementsByClassName, and getElementsByTagName
* How to select radio buttons, checkboxes, and form inputs using getElementsByName
* How to use modern CSS selectors with querySelector and querySelectorAll
* Key differences between HTMLCollection and NodeList (live vs static)
* How to safely update text with textContent and form values with .value
* How to dynamically manipulate CSS styles (colors, fonts, display none/block)
* How to handle user interactions using addEventListener ('click', 'input')
* Step-by-step walkthrough of a practical project with reset functionality

